     "notes": "All 56 paired Au conventional-cell volumes and temperatures are bundled, but the Tsuchiya (2003) ab initio Au thermal EOS is not an executable Peritheos pressure-standard record. Exact pressure re-reduction therefore awaits that separate calibration record."
    },
